{{!
  Google Calendar API events response, rendered by the WireMock response
  template transformer.

  The bookings transcribe the "current week" of the demo content in
  src/services/DemoCalendarAdapter.ts: the same rooms, bookers and times,
  one line per booking. Dates are not hardcoded: every event is placed
  relative to the Monday of the week the app requested (its timeMin query
  parameter), so week navigation in the UI keeps hitting the same pattern.

  Editable bookings carry the creator email of the mocked user
  (ber@boekjehokje.test, see e2e/fixtures/auth.ts), since editability is
  decided by creator email vs. profile email (ADR-0004).
}}
